## Interface: 16001
## Title: MMT - Quality of life
## Notes: MMT module: small team conveniences. Keeps Dejunk's junk lists and Baganator's category items the same on every character of the team. Sends ForeverAuras auras and EllesmereUI profiles to the team, calls out SmartBuff alerts, lets RestedXP Guides wait for the party before its next step, leaves Dejunk / Baganator junk on the corpse as master looter, shows a role's items beside the bags (for trade and mail), shares Auctionator and FojjiCore auction scans with the team, and exports or copies the MMT profile with other names.
## Version: 1.7.3
## Author: Quiding
## X-Repository: https://github.com/Quiding/mmt_modules
## X-License: GPL-3.0
## Dependencies: MMT
## DefaultState: disabled
## X-MMT-DefaultState: disabled
## OptionalDeps: MMT_LootDistribution, Dejunk, Baganator, Auctionator, FojjiCore_Professions, ForeverAuras, EllesmereUI, SmartBuff, RXPGuides
## X-MMT-Module: 1
## X-MMT-Title: Quality of life
